{"id":"c88d34f9d8f9da3a","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-digital-signature.md","title":"Digital Signature Scheme","display":"df-digital-signature — Digital Signature Scheme","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-digital-signature","aliases":["28-df-digital-signature","Digital Signature Scheme"],"display":"df-digital-signature — Digital Signature Scheme","depends_on":["[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-negl]]"],"source_book_location":"Chapter 9 notes/history mentions digital signatures; printed pp.195–196; PDF pp.221–222","source_printed_pages":"195–196","source_pdf_pages":"221–222","source_status":"supplementary-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-digital-signature"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-digital-signature</span><span>Digital Signature Scheme</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-digital-signature — Digital Signature Scheme"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Chapter 9 notes/history mentions digital signatures; printed pp.195–196; PDF pp.221–222"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"195–196"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"221–222"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Sign},\\operatorname{Ver},(\\mathcal M_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Sign},\\operatorname{Ver},(\\mathcal M_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Sign}\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Sign}\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ver}\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ver}\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>，见所列本地定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\Pr[\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)\\in\\{\\langle vk,sk\\rangle:vk,sk\\in\\mathbb B^*\\}]=1\">\\(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\Pr[\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)\\in\\{\\langle vk,sk\\rangle:vk,sk\\in\\mathbb B^*\\}]=1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Keys}_{\\Sigma,n}\">\\(\\mathsf{Keys}_{\\Sigma,n}\\)</span> 为下式给出的解码密钥分布；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_n\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\">\\(\\mathcal M_n\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\)</span> 非空有限。消息、生成的密钥及合法消息的签名长度均由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的固定多项式统一有界；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ver}_{vk}(m,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbb B\">\\(\\operatorname{Ver}_{vk}(m,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbb B\\)</span>。当前安全参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sign}_{sk}(m)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sign}(\\langle1^n,sk,m\\rangle)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sign}_{sk}(m)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sign}(\\langle1^n,sk,m\\rangle)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ver}_{vk}(m,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ver}(\\langle1^n,vk,m,\\sigma\\rangle)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ver}_{vk}(m,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ver}(\\langle1^n,vk,m,\\sigma\\rangle)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle:\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathbb B^*)^j\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb B^*\">\\(\\langle\\cdot\\rangle:\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathbb B^*)^j\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb B^*\\)</span> 为固定单射扁平有限序列编码，编码像可多项式时间判定，编码和像上的逆均为多项式时间，码长与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j+\\sum_{h=1}^j|u_h|+1\">\\(j+\\sum_{h=1}^j|u_h|+1\\)</span> 彼此多项式有界；数值标签和轮次采用无前导零二进制串，历史是有限消息串列表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{hist}\">\\(\\operatorname{hist}\\)</span> 将其一次序列化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^j\">\\(\\mathbb B^j\\)</span> 上均匀分布；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空串。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 为有限历史的追加，历史开始于空序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"()\">\\(()\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>攻击者参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(q,b,l,H)\">\\(A=(q,b,l,H)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,b,l\\in\\mathbb N[n]\">\\(q,b,l\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(H\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>；随机种子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb B^{b(n)}\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb B^{b(n)}\\)</span>；全部签名应答使用独立新鲜随机性。下式的有限随机递归和末尾返回值采用顺序随机赋值语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists J\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathbb B^*\\quad J(\\langle1^n,m\\rangle)=\\mathbf1[m\\in\\mathcal M_n]\">\\(\\exists J\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathbb B^*\\quad J(\\langle1^n,m\\rangle)=\\mathbf1[m\\in\\mathcal M_n]\\)</span>；消息合法性检验统一有效。单比特串与0、1认同。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Keys}_{\\Sigma,n}(vk,sk)\\coloneqq\\Pr[\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)=\\langle vk,sk\\rangle]\\quad((vk,sk)\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Keys}_{\\Sigma,n}(vk,sk)\\coloneqq\\Pr[\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)=\\langle vk,sk\\rangle]\\quad((vk,sk)\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{hist}((w_1,\\ldots,w_j))\\coloneqq\\langle w_1,\\ldots,w_j\\rangle\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N,\\ (w_1,\\ldots,w_j)\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{hist}((w_1,\\ldots,w_j))\\coloneqq\\langle w_1,\\ldots,w_j\\rangle\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N,\\ (w_1,\\ldots,w_j)\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\mathbb N[n]^3\\times\\mathbf{FP},\\qquad\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}u&amp;|u|\\le l(n),\\\\\\langle0\\rangle&amp;|u|&gt;l(n).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\mathbb N[n]^3\\times\\mathbf{FP},\\qquad\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}u&amp;|u|\\le l(n),\\\\\\langle0\\rangle&amp;|u|&gt;l(n).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K_{\\Sigma,n,sk}(u)(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\Pr[\\langle1,\\operatorname{Sign}_{sk}(m)\\rangle=v]&amp;u=\\langle1,m\\rangle,\\ m\\in\\mathcal M_n,\\\\\\mathbf1[v=\\langle0\\rangle]&amp;\\neg\\exists m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\ u=\\langle1,m\\rangle.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf K_{\\Sigma,n,sk}(u)(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\Pr[\\langle1,\\operatorname{Sign}_{sk}(m)\\rangle=v]&amp;u=\\langle1,m\\rangle,\\ m\\in\\mathcal M_n,\\\\\\mathbf1[v=\\langle0\\rangle]&amp;\\neg\\exists m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\ u=\\langle1,m\\rangle.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Correct}(\\Sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\quad\\Pr_{(vk,sk)\\leftarrow\\mathsf{Keys}_{\\Sigma,n},\\ \\sigma\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Sign}_{sk}(m)}[\\operatorname{Ver}_{vk}(m,\\sigma)=1]=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Correct}(\\Sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\quad\\Pr_{(vk,sk)\\leftarrow\\mathsf{Keys}_{\\Sigma,n},\\ \\sigma\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Sign}_{sk}(m)}[\\operatorname{Ver}_{vk}(m,\\sigma)=1]=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Forge}_{\\Sigma,A}(n)\\coloneqq\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;(vk,sk)\\leftarrow\\mathsf{Keys}_{\\Sigma,n};\\quad r\\leftarrow U_{b(n)};\\quad t_0\\leftarrow();\\\\&amp;u_i\\leftarrow\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(H(\\langle0,1^n,vk,r,i,\\operatorname{hist}(t_{i-1})\\rangle));\\quad v_i\\leftarrow\\mathsf K_{\\Sigma,n,sk}(u_i);\\quad t_i\\leftarrow t_{i-1}^{\\frown}(u_i,v_i)\\quad(1\\le i\\le q(n));\\\\&amp;z\\leftarrow H(\\langle1,1^n,vk,r,\\operatorname{hist}(t_{q(n)})\\rangle);\\\\&amp;\\mathbf1[\\exists m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\ \\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathbb B^*\\ (z=\\langle m,\\sigma\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{Ver}_{vk}(m,\\sigma)=1\\land\\forall i\\in[q(n)]\\ u_i\\ne\\langle1,m\\rangle)]\\end{aligned}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Forge}_{\\Sigma,A}(n)\\coloneqq\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;(vk,sk)\\leftarrow\\mathsf{Keys}_{\\Sigma,n};\\quad r\\leftarrow U_{b(n)};\\quad t_0\\leftarrow();\\\\&amp;u_i\\leftarrow\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(H(\\langle0,1^n,vk,r,i,\\operatorname{hist}(t_{i-1})\\rangle));\\quad v_i\\leftarrow\\mathsf K_{\\Sigma,n,sk}(u_i);\\quad t_i\\leftarrow t_{i-1}^{\\frown}(u_i,v_i)\\quad(1\\le i\\le q(n));\\\\&amp;z\\leftarrow H(\\langle1,1^n,vk,r,\\operatorname{hist}(t_{q(n)})\\rangle);\\\\&amp;\\mathbf1[\\exists m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\ \\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathbb B^*\\ (z=\\langle m,\\sigma\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{Ver}_{vk}(m,\\sigma)=1\\land\\forall i\\in[q(n)]\\ u_i\\ne\\langle1,m\\rangle)]\\end{aligned}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EUFCMA}(\\Sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\quad\\left(n\\mapsto\\Pr[\\operatorname{Forge}_{\\Sigma,A}(n)=1]\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EUFCMA}(\\Sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\quad\\left(n\\mapsto\\Pr[\\operatorname{Forge}_{\\Sigma,A}(n)=1]\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>消息域族现为方案的显式分量。攻击者由多项式轮数、种子长度、查询长度上界和一个FP函数构造；查询标签1表示真实询问，其余为无操作。查询裁剪、签名长度界与扁平历史保证每轮输入及总计算长度多项式；固定随机种子可保留自适应攻击者的内部随机性。原书提到数字签名及 GMR84 的历史来源，但没有给出上述完整 EUF-CMA 实验。本节点保留为标明身份的补充形式接口；不将书中伪随机函数的共享密钥消息认证码误作公钥数字签名。伪造输出、新鲜消息条件、签名应答核及全部概率来源均在前两节形式展开，不再依赖一个仅用中文命名的轨迹集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-negl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"攻击者参数为 $A=(q,b,l,H)$；$q,b,l\\in\\mathbb N[n]$，$H\\in\\mathbf{FP}$；随机种子 $r\\in\\mathbb B^{b(n)}$；全部签名应答使用独立新鲜随机性。下式的有限随机递归和末尾返回值采用顺序随机赋值语法；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Sign},\\operatorname{Ver},(\\mathcal M_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Sign}\\in\\mathbf{PPT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ver}\\in\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\Pr[\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)\\in\\{\\langle vk,sk\\rangle:vk,sk\\in\\mathbb B^*\\}]=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Keys}_{\\Sigma,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_n\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ver}_{vk}(m,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sign}_{sk}(m)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sign}(\\langle1^n,sk,m\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ver}_{vk}(m,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ver}(\\langle1^n,vk,m,\\sigma\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle:\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathbb B^*)^j\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb B^*","display":false},{"tex":"j+\\sum_{h=1}^j|u_h|+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{hist}","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^j","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"()","display":false},{"tex":"A=(q,b,l,H)","display":false},{"tex":"q,b,l\\in\\mathbb N[n]","display":false},{"tex":"H\\in\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb B^{b(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Negl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists J\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathbb B^*\\quad J(\\langle1^n,m\\rangle)=\\mathbf1[m\\in\\mathcal M_n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Keys}_{\\Sigma,n}(vk,sk)\\coloneqq\\Pr[\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)=\\langle vk,sk\\rangle]\\quad((vk,sk)\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^2).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{hist}((w_1,\\ldots,w_j))\\coloneqq\\langle w_1,\\ldots,w_j\\rangle\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N,\\ (w_1,\\ldots,w_j)\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^j).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\mathbb N[n]^3\\times\\mathbf{FP},\\qquad\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}u&|u|\\le l(n),\\\\\\langle0\\rangle&|u|>l(n).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf K_{\\Sigma,n,sk}(u)(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\Pr[\\langle1,\\operatorname{Sign}_{sk}(m)\\rangle=v]&u=\\langle1,m\\rangle,\\ m\\in\\mathcal M_n,\\\\\\mathbf1[v=\\langle0\\rangle]&\\neg\\exists m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\ u=\\langle1,m\\rangle.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Correct}(\\Sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\quad\\Pr_{(vk,sk)\\leftarrow\\mathsf{Keys}_{\\Sigma,n},\\ \\sigma\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Sign}_{sk}(m)}[\\operatorname{Ver}_{vk}(m,\\sigma)=1]=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Forge}_{\\Sigma,A}(n)\\coloneqq\\left[\\begin{aligned}&(vk,sk)\\leftarrow\\mathsf{Keys}_{\\Sigma,n};\\quad r\\leftarrow U_{b(n)};\\quad t_0\\leftarrow();\\\\&u_i\\leftarrow\\operatorname{cap}_{n,l}(H(\\langle0,1^n,vk,r,i,\\operatorname{hist}(t_{i-1})\\rangle));\\quad v_i\\leftarrow\\mathsf K_{\\Sigma,n,sk}(u_i);\\quad t_i\\leftarrow t_{i-1}^{\\frown}(u_i,v_i)\\quad(1\\le i\\le q(n));\\\\&z\\leftarrow H(\\langle1,1^n,vk,r,\\operatorname{hist}(t_{q(n)})\\rangle);\\\\&\\mathbf1[\\exists m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\ \\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathbb B^*\\ (z=\\langle m,\\sigma\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{Ver}_{vk}(m,\\sigma)=1\\land\\forall i\\in[q(n)]\\ u_i\\ne\\langle1,m\\rangle)]\\end{aligned}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EUFCMA}(\\Sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\quad\\left(n\\mapsto\\Pr[\\operatorname{Forge}_{\\Sigma,A}(n)=1]\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.","display":true}],"bytes":4990,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-164","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"密码方案：[[28-df-symmetric-encryption]]、[[28-df-ind-cpa]]、[[28-df-trapdoor-permutation]]、[[28-df-digital-signature]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75200f005282ddf","adb92775ec020a0b","f3171800627deef3"]}